Expose nearest blocked/triage ancestor as optional local-board presentation evidence. Breadth-first traversal guards cycles and caps depth at 20; old schemas fail soft. Replica cards remain unchanged.

Proof: new tests fail on original source; 68 tests pass including session_tasks chain integration and nearest/depth/cycle/status controls. scripts/check --base origin/main passes all 21 checks; health clean.
